Volume: ~3,000–6,000 invoices/yr
Owner: Rental Billing Lead
Participants: Credit/Billing, Customer, Finance
Source: workflow W5335 — Equipment Rental Billing, Deposit/Hold Management &amp; Settlement</bpmn:documentation>
