Responsible (R): Rental Billing Lead
Accountable (A): Rental Billing Lead
Duration: 10 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5335_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5335_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
