    <bpmn:process id="W_W5336" name="W5336. Lost, Stolen or Abandoned Equipment Recovery, Recovery Agent &amp; Police Coordination" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Geofence breach unresolved (W5332), overdue non-return (VS-12.2 W1375 escalation), or unit abandoned
Frequency: Rare (~0.3–1% of rentals); high impact
Volume: ~15–60 incidents/yr
Owner: Loss Prevention Officer
Participants: Corporate Security (VS-159), Legal (VS-100), Police, Insurance (VS-26), Recovery Agent
Source: workflow W5336 — Lost, Stolen or Abandoned Equipment Recovery, Recovery Agent &amp; Police Coordination</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5336_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5336_Lane1" name="Loss Prevention Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5336_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5336_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5336_Lane2" name="Corporate Security">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5336_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5336_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5336_Lane3" name="Risk &amp; Insurance Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5336_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5336_Lane4" name="Legal Counsel">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5336_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5336_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5336_Start6" name="Geofence breach unresolved (W5332), overdue non-return (VS-12.2 W1375 escalation), or…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5336_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5336_Task7" name="Confirm the loss: telematics last-known location, kill-switch activation, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Confirm the loss: telematics last-known location, kill-switch activation, and contact attempts to the renter.
Responsible (R): Loss Prevention Officer
Accountable (A): Loss Prevention Officer
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5336_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5336_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5336_Task8" name="Escalate to Corporate Security and engage a licensed recovery agent; file a…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Escalate to Corporate Security and engage a licensed recovery agent; file a police report (theft/embezzlement under RPC).
Responsible (R): Corporate Security
Accountable (A): Loss Prevention Officer
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5336_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5336_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5336_Task9" name="Notify insurance/captive (W5327/VS-26) within the policy notice window…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Notify insurance/captive (W5327/VS-26) within the policy notice window; preserve evidence for the claim.
Responsible (R): Risk &amp; Insurance Manager
Accountable (A): Loss Prevention Officer
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5336_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5336_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5336_Task10" name="Coordinate recovery/repo where located; if unrecoverable, process the claim and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Coordinate recovery/repo where located; if unrecoverable, process the claim and charge-off (VS-35).
Responsible (R): Corporate Security
Accountable (A): Loss Prevention Officer
Duration: varies</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5336_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5336_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5336_Task11" name="Update the renter record (blacklist), file legal recovery of the unit value…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Update the renter record (blacklist), file legal recovery of the unit value (VS-100), and capture lessons-learned.
Responsible (R): Legal Counsel
Accountable (A): Loss Prevention Officer
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5336_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5336_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5336_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5336_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
